"According to the last paragraph, what practical question does the four-layer model turn a vague question into?": "28d9912b6a03",
"According to the passage, what does the \"defense, qi, nutritive, blood\" framework map, as distinct from describing healthy body function?": "d9fcc14bb932",
"According to the passage, what symptoms mark the qi-level stage, and how do they differ from the defense-level stage?": "a6752f6432da",
"Her eyes were reddened from lack of sleep.": "34492f9a5489",
